      "start_seconds": 257.66,
      "end_seconds": 272.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.45,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
