      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.23,
      "end_seconds": 289.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible adrenal crisis after stopping steroids is my leading thought, not anything worse."
